---
---
<aside class="hidden md:block w-[340px] flex-shrink-0 p-6 sticky top-[113px] h-[calc(100vh-113px)] overflow-y-auto border-l border-border-dim">
  <h3 class="font-display text-base text-bone mb-4 tracking-[0.05em]">Tu Pedido</h3>
  <div id="sidebar-order-content">
    <p class="text-muted text-[0.82rem] text-center py-8">
      Tu pedido está vacío.<br />Arma tu ramen para comenzar.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div id="sidebar-total" class="hidden">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-3 mt-2 border-t border-border font-display text-base">
      <span>Total</span>
      <span class="text-red text-[1.2rem]" id="sidebar-total-price">$0</span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 mt-4">
      <button
        class="w-full py-3 rounded-[7px] bg-red text-white border-0 font-semibold text-[0.9rem] tracking-[0.05em] transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-red-dark"
        id="confirm-btn"
      >
        Confirmar Pedido
      </button>
      <button
        class="w-full py-[0.6rem] rounded-[7px] bg-transparent text-muted border border-border-dim text-[0.8rem] transition-all duration-150 hover:text-bone hover:border-white/20"
        id="clear-btn"
      >
        Limpiar pedido
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>